; rdy_f8: what follows a stretched cycle, at fX/8
; Generated by validation/v35s/ready.py emit: the bytes are the generator's; the image
; also holds wtc.py's fill, sleds and stubs (base_image). READY holds (register 0Ah) run: 0 16 48 80 112 144 176 208 240 255; x_half [2]
    DB 0FAh    ; DI
    DB 0B8h, 00h, 00h    ; MOV AW, 0000h
